{"id":"83a531a86e2949a9","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-comb5-matching.md","title":"ZFC Comb5 Matching","display":"df-zfc-comb5-matching — ZFC Comb5 Matching","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb5-matching","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb5-matching"],"display":"df-zfc-comb5-matching — ZFC Comb5 Matching","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb5-matching"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-matching</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb5-matching — ZFC Comb5 Matching"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (vertex set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq[V]^2\">\\(E\\subseteq[V]^2\\)</span> (edge set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subseteq E\">\\(M\\subseteq E\\)</span> (candidate matching)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> (simple undirected graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Matching}\">\\(\\operatorname{Matching}\\)</span> (ternary predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}matching} \\vdash \\operatorname{Matching}(V,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land M\\subseteq E\\land \\forall e_0,e_1\\in M\\;(e_0\\neq e_1\\to e_0\\cap e_1=\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}matching} \\vdash \\operatorname{Matching}(V,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land M\\subseteq E\\land \\forall e_0,e_1\\in M\\;(e_0\\neq e_1\\to e_0\\cap e_1=\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Distinct edges in a matching have no common endpoint.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V$ (vertex set, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq[V]^2$ (edge set, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S$ (simple undirected graph predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq[V]^2","display":false},{"tex":"M\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Matching}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}matching} \\vdash \\operatorname{Matching}(V,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land M\\subseteq E\\land \\forall e_0,e_1\\in M\\;(e_0\\neq e_1\\to e_0\\cap e_1=\\varnothing)","display":true}],"bytes":934,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1658","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-comb5-matching.md|58-df-zfc-comb5-matching]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["0dc79ccc1050ee64"]}